  m_text: Semi-transparent and shapeless, Slimes manipulate their form to handle
    utensils with ease. Though they can digest solid food, it often leads to discomfort.
    They show strong preference for liquid meals. May visibly bubble or tremble when
    exposed to irritating seasonings.
